{"4336450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Help Is On The Way", "steam_appid": 4336450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Is On The Way is a sci-fi security simulation where survival depends on what you can’t see directly. You play as Kassandra, a security officer stationed behind a malfunctioning terminal in a remote mining facility. When something goes terribly wrong, your coworker Conor is left navigating the facility’s corridors alone, while you guide him from afar using unreliable security systems.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/15eacc4df77a229391c738501e002f61.poster.avif?t=1770409576\" width=900 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/15eacc4df77a229391c738501e002f61.webm?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/15eacc4df77a229391c738501e002f61.mp4?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Conor must finish the remaining work for the day before the escape pod can launch, but an alien presence now stalks the facility. If he dies both your lives are over.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/ef163b87666e7155a97fbc62e40539e9.poster.avif?t=1770409576\" width=900 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/ef163b87666e7155a97fbc62e40539e9.webm?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/ef163b87666e7155a97fbc62e40539e9.mp4?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From your terminal, you’ll monitor the facility by shuffling between security cameras, watching for hazards, locked-down areas, and signs of the creature lurking in the dark. You can open, close, and lock doors remotely to control Conor’s path, protect him from danger, or trap threats; if your system allows it.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/60393051d6facac8a3ab06ac7b9b7438.poster.avif?t=1770409576\" width=900 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/60393051d6facac8a3ab06ac7b9b7438.webm?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/60393051d6facac8a3ab06ac7b9b7438.mp4?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your terminal is unstable. Overheating systems will shut down your view, forcing you to cool them manually before you can regain control. On top of that, strict corporate protocols mean you’ll need to sign access papers to authorize certain actions, slowing you down when every second matters.  <br>  <br>Balance limited information, failing hardware, and bureaucratic obstacles as you guide Conor through a deadly workday. <strong>Help is on the way</strong>; but only if you can keep the terminal working long enough!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Is On The Way is a sci-fi security simulation where survival depends on what you can’t see directly. You play as Kassandra, a security officer stationed behind a malfunctioning terminal in a remote mining facility. When something goes terribly wrong, your coworker Conor is left navigating the facility’s corridors alone, while you guide him from afar using unreliable security systems.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/15eacc4df77a229391c738501e002f61.poster.avif?t=1770409576\" width=900 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/15eacc4df77a229391c738501e002f61.webm?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/15eacc4df77a229391c738501e002f61.mp4?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Conor must finish the remaining work for the day before the escape pod can launch, but an alien presence now stalks the facility. If he dies both your lives are over.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/ef163b87666e7155a97fbc62e40539e9.poster.avif?t=1770409576\" width=900 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/ef163b87666e7155a97fbc62e40539e9.webm?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336450/extras/ef163b87666e7155a97fbc62e40539e9.mp4?t=1770409576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From your terminal, you’ll monitor the facility by shuffling between security cameras, watching for hazards, locked-down areas, and signs of the creature lurking in the dark. You can open, close, and lock doors remotely to control Conor’s path, protect him from danger, or trap threats; if your system allows it.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline